# Core Architecture

## POC Gate
Do not build product features until `poc.tsx` passes all 4 kill-switch tests. Never import from `poc.tsx` into product code.

## Platform
Production targets are **iOS and Android only**. Web is dev UI testing — no web parity requirements.

## Monorepo
- Use `yarn workspace casescriptai <script>` for app commands
- Check `packages/*` before creating new utilities (packages are planned, not all exist yet)
- Do not add dependencies without explicit need

## Eval
- Never auto-generate or modify `eval/golden-dataset/`
- Suggest eval after changes to `whisper.ts`, `llm.ts`, or `prompts.ts`
- Never commit `eval/results/`

## Paywall
Trial-gated features: `router.push('/paywall')` at navigation layer. UI-only hiding is not a gate.

## Security
- No PHI in production logs
- No secrets in `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` env vars
- De-identify audio before adding to golden dataset
